summary.label:
SavouryList is a shopping list application. It will help you to remember to buy everything you need in a shop.

• Multiple shopping lists;
• Striking out bought items;
• iCloud synchronization between your iOS devices;
• Intelligent prompts will enable you to write down shopping lists faster;
• Sharing of shopping lists to your relatives or friends;
• Apple Watch.

SavouryPot - a recipe manager from the same developer - can export recipe ingredients to SavouryList.
